div.p:
I. 1. And first, ‘If thine eye be single, thy whole body shall be full of light.’ If thine eye be single, if God is in all thy thoughts,
See Ps. 10:4. if thou art constantly aiming at him that is invisible; if it be thy intention in all things, small and great, in all thy conversation, to please God, to do not thy own will but the will of him that sent thee into the world;
See John 6:38. if thou canst say, not to any creature, but to him that made thee for himself,
